	(text "Conventions\n• Generated by hardware/gen + hardware/b1 (Python). Do not edit in KiCad: change the code and regenerate.\n• Power nets use power symbols: VBUS, +5V, +3V3, +3.3VA (filtered analog), GND.\n• Global labels cross sheets; local labels stay on one sheet.\n• Reference designators: 1xx power, 2xx driver, 3xx power stage, 4xx MCU, 5xx encoder, 6xx CAN, 7xx aux.\n• DNP parts (snubbers, phase-voltage taps, I2C pull-ups) are footprints for experiments on rev A.\n• Planning docs: docs/01–09 (pin map: docs/04-architecture.md; parts: docs/03-parts.md)."
